WEBVTT

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.760
Goldion Hammer!

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:33.680
A megaton tool capable of devastating destruction, the Goldion Hammer.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:36.720
But its power is so overwhelming that...

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:43.850
...the resulting damage to GaoGaiGar is more serious than anticipated.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.520
For that reason, GGG began work on...

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:50.150
...making significant modifications to the Goldion Hammer.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.700
Once this project is finished...

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.530
...you won't have to use Hell and Heaven anymore, will you?

00:00:58.700 --> 00:00:59.580
Right.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.160
Let's just hope the Zonders don't cause any trouble before then.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:04.910
Oh, um, Gai...

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.000
Here.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:12.050
So you were holding onto that for me, Mikoto?

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:13.590
Thanks!

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.220
Um, I'm really sorry.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:19.550
I guess I'm not fit to be a GGG member.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:23.430
I'm supposed to be supporting you, Gai, but instead I...

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:25.180
Don't worry about it.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.940
It's not your fault, Mikoto, it's the Zonders'...

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:35.190
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:38.090
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:44.830
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:49.090
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:55.810
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:00.090
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:05.010
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:08.930
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:11.730
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:15.490
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:20.490
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:23.660
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:26.200
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:29.330
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:32.290
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:36.370
Dividing Driver!

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:44.010
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:49.890
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:49.890 --> 00:02:52.840
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:56.730
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:56.070 --> 00:02:58.740
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.700
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:04.160
Zonder Teacher

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:06.790
<i>Zonder Teacher</i>

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.550
We're gonna be late!

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:22.090
It's all because you made me show you my homework, Ushi!

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.640
Hey, you blaming me?

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:25.180
Well, it is your fault!

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:26.560
So I'm the only one to blame, huh?

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.600
We'd better hurry or we're really going to be late!

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:29.810
Oh, that's right!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.390
Wait up!

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:32.650
You boys there!

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.690
It's the Vice Principal!

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:39.820
We're dead!

00:03:40.110 --> 00:03:41.400
Look at that!

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.870
You haven't even closed your lockers! And you left your shoes lying about!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:48.540
Kamome Elementary School No. 1, Regulation No. 24!

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.370
"All students must store their shoes neatly in their lockers."

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.210
Have you forgotten that rule?

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.380
We're really, really sorry!

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.340
How dare you litter...

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.890
Kamome Elementary School No. 1, Regulation No. 17!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.220
"Students are expected to show all test results to their parents..."

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:11.430
Sueo Ushiyama!

00:04:11.560 --> 00:04:12.690
Yes, sir!

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.900
What is the meaning of this?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.610
Oh, um, you see...

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:18.230
I'm really sorry!

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.280
Oh, no! We're out of time!

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:20.900
What?

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.240
We gotta get going!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:24.450
Just a minute, boys!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:25.660
Yes, sir!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.700
Kamome Elementary School No. 1, Regulation No. 3!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.660
"Absolutely no running in the halls!"

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.250
You know what I'm talking about!

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.410
Yes, but...

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.670
If we don't run...

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.420
We'll be marked late!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.920
We're sorry!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.920
Kamome Elementary School No. 1, Regulation No. 1...

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.930
"Students must follow the rules of this school."

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.720
Why can't they follow the rules?

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.890
Kamome Elementary School No. 1, Regulation No. 2...

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:53.940
10th grade

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:57.810
For gosh sakes! That Vice Principal's always nagging us!

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:58.770
I know!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:03.320
Kamome Elementary School No. 1, Regulation No. 248...

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:09.530
Truly, children today have no respect whatsoever for school regulations...

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.160
They're sloppy about cleaning classrooms, don't finish school lunches...

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:15.290
They really seem to have no idea what proper deportment is!

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.550
Who's there? How dare you fool around in the lavatory!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.470
Don't you know that class is in session?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.600
W-Who in the world are you?

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:35.640
This school is about to turn over a new leaf under your guidance!

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.980
All right, now who knows the answer to this problem?

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.610
I know, Teacher!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:45.860
All right, then Sugishima and Yamaguchi, come on up!

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:46.820
Okay!

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:56.710
It's a Zonder!

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:03.460
You must all make this classroom spick-and-span!

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:06.300
No! What's this?

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:10.600
Wait a minute! What's going on here?

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.680
Make a run for it, guys!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:42.340
If you all make your classrooms spick-and-span...

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:47.090
Zonder!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.850
Looks like we're safe here.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:07:00.650
But I think everyone else got captured...

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:02.270
What was that thing, anyway?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.360
Don't tell me it was a monster!

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.530
Guess what, guys, I know what it is!

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.570
That's what they call a Zonder!

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.400
Zonder?

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.740
Is that the same thing that destroyed my hot-air balloon?

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:16.740
The mechanoid who was in the deep-sea submersible!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:21.040
It's the comrade of that thing that attacked us at Garbage Island!

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.960
Zonder!

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.930
What? I don't like the sound of that!

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.430
Really, now! Don't just leave me behind like that!

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.890
It's your own fault for going to the bathroom at a time like this...

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:41.890
What's that?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.690
Uh, nothing!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:49.030
Put your shoes in your lockers like you're supposed to!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.990
Zonder!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:53.660
He found us!

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.790
No running in the halls!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.960
Kamome Elementary School No. 1, Regulation No. 3!

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.500
He sounds just like you-know-who...

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.550
Don't tell me the Vice Principal got Zonderized?

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:11.920
Ushi!

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:23.940
Mamoru!

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.650
I'm not afraid! I'm not afraid!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.530
This is really bad! This is really bad! This is really bad!

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.030
Why, you stinker!

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.790
Hey, that wasn't bad at all!

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.590
Sorry, guys!

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:51.590
Waha!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.060
Emergency! Emergency!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:10.690
Mom or Dad or Nana, I don't care who! Pick up the phone already!

00:09:10.860 --> 00:09:13.440
Hey! What happens if you call 119 again?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.860
Please come soon, Big Brother Gai...

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:19.700
Mamoru?

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:25.040
"Today we're having hamburgers for lunch. I just can't wait!"

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.710
That's what he says!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.880
Really! Paging you over something like that...

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.540
Here we were thinking it was a Zonder!

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:33.840
It's an important issue for kids his age, I guess...

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:34.510
Whoops.

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:38.510
It's no good, my message is getting scrambled!

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:41.930
I can't get through to my parents or the police!

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.060
If only I could get in touch with my big brother!

00:09:44.230 --> 00:09:45.560
What are we gonna do?

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.980
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:49.650
Hey! Hey!

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:53.070
Cut that out! What if the Zonder finds us here?

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.740
Look over there! See it?

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.110
It's a police car!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.950
Hey, it's Volfogg!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.910
Save us! Over here!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.960
That policeman, doesn't he hear us?

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.750
No way!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.170
What's the matter, Hana?

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:11.920
See!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:15.840
Here it comes!

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.550
Piece of cake!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.760
Hey, that's us over there!

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.010
What's going on?

00:10:25.140 --> 00:10:26.560
A hologram?

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:30.150
The Zonder is projecting 3-D images of us from somewhere inside the school!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.200
No way!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.240
Watch out!

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:45.870
Time: 1230 hours. I have confirmed Special Agent Mamoru's safety.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.870
Completing my rounds...

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.000
He's gone!

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:54.840
But Volfogg can see through any trick, just like a ninja!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.590
And even he got fooled?

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:03.930
Kamome Elementary School No. 1, Regulation No. 6...

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:08.060
School lunches must be eaten without complaint! Finish your food!

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:16.320
Why, you...

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.150
I was looking forward to lunch!

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.650
Hey, calm down, will you?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:23.200
If we get out of this alive, I promise you I'll treat you to a feast!

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.790
Oh, I'll treat you to some foie gras or caviar if you want!

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:29.540
Know what I want right now? Curry!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.580
I want some beef and rice!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.000
Lunch!

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:45.050
He's found us again!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:45.800
Library

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.630
Looks like we somehow managed to get away!

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:19.880
But listen... there's no way we're gonna survive, is there?

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:20.800
Huh?

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:21.970
I think he's right.

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:24.890
There's just no way out of this place, no matter what we do!

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.810
No! Give me back my splendid life!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:31.810
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid!

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:33.140
Hey, hold up, you guys!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:35.690
It's still too soon to give up!

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:39.070
There's got to... there's just got to be a way to get out of this!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.400
So come on, let's put our heads together and figure it out!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.450
Zonder!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.370
He's here!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.340
The Zonder...

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:08.720
If the Vice Principal would go back to normal, everyone will be saved...

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:12.100
And the only one who can do that is me!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:16.730
Mamoru?

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:17.900
Watch out!

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.440
Don't tell me...

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.820
He's got some kind of killer move or something?

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:24.400
Please...

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.320
Just don't move, all right?

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.250
Mamoru!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:37.960
What do you think you're doing, anyway?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:42.460
Zonder!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:48.220
If we can get that child out of the way, we'll be able to achieve our goals...

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.220
This is it, after all...

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:56.480
I'm not afraid!

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:59.940
You let go of Mamoru now!

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.070
Reiko, Takayasu! Come on!

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:03.400
B-But...

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.780
My big brother always says...

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.320
...at times like these, you can make up for anything with courage!

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:08.780
Charge!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.200
Take this!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:14.950
Waha!

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:18.420
Time: 1300 hours. I have confirmed Special Agent Mamoru's safety...

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:23.340
Zonder!

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.340
I guess we didn't have enough courage!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:34.350
I never dreamed my charmed life would end in a place like this!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:39.230
As if I'd ever let that happen! No way!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:42.520
What was that, just now?

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:45.320
Impossible!

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.030
It's the exact same image I saw 31 minutes ago!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.120
If that's the case, then what is going on?

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.290
System Change!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:06.340
Volfogg!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.890
Just as I thought, it's a hologram.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:20.140
There you are, Zonder!

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:29.780
GunGlue! GunDober!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.110
Three Become One!

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:44.880
Big Volfogg!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:47.340
An alert from Big Volfogg has just come in.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:51.090
He's in G-Island City, Point 12 in battle with a Zonder!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.930
But that's Mamoru's school!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.600
Curse those Zonders, striking again...

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.890
Mobile Unit, get ready for battle at once!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:10.570
GaoGaiGar's repairs will be completed in 4 minutes.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.240
Dividing Driver Equip Mode, prepare for launch!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.620
Zonder!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:20.910
Waging war here would put the school and Special Agent Mamoru in danger.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.630
I have no choice, then.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.050
I'll just take out that Zonder with a concentrated blast!

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:30.170
4,000 Magnum!

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:33.260
What the...

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.350
Big Volfogg!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.390
What a dirty trick...

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.350
This is concentrated sulphuric acid!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:56.660
System Change!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:00.990
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:03.580
You can let the Mobile Unit take it from here!

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:07.000
Yeah, it's lighter than we thought! The two of us can handle it!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.000
Please, wait!

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:10.500
Special Agent Mamoru and the others are hanging on inside!

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:11.420
What did you say?

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:25.690
The superconducting coils entwined around the robots are...

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:29.230
...subjecting them to massive electromagnetic pressure.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.150
Oh, no! The robots just got squished!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.940
I guess this is it!

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:41.410
Taking Mamoru and his friends hostage...

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:43.200
How low can you go, anyway?

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:48.130
Dividing Driver!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:05.270
It's that black robot!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.560
We're saved!

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.060
Protect Shade!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:18.410
I won't be able to save the kids like this, much less defeat that Zonder!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:21.490
Chief! Now that it's come to this, I've got to use Hell and Heaven!

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:22.530
Hold on!

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:26.040
They're be there soon. And then, the real battle will begin!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.250
They?

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.580
...that's right!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.050
The Pliers will reach their destination in 2 minutes!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:42.760
The Zonder core is located just behind Mamoru and his friends.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:44.310
You couldn't ask for a better target than that!

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:45.520
HyoRyu!

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.430
EnRyu!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.060
Stand-by, okay!

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:50.520
Hey, the blue and red robots are free now, too!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.400
Hurry up and save us!

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:54.730
Big Volfogg, do you think you can make it?

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:55.780
I intend to try.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:58.150
Right, don't hold back, now!

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:00.200
We only have one chance to get it right!

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.240
Diamond Formation, approved!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.700
Roger!

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:08.750
Symmetrical Docking!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:26.220
ChoRyuJin!

00:19:26.470 --> 00:19:30.390
Finishing move, Whirling Death Strike!

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:37.440
No good! No good!

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:39.400
Right, now's our chance!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:43.240
Goldion Hammer!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.330
Activation, approved!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.660
Roger!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:51.500
Goldion Hammer...

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:55.040
Safety Device, relieve!

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:04.340
Let's do it, Pliers!

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:09.430
Dimensional Pliers!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:11.730
Tool Connect!

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:29.830
Over here, Zonder!

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:33.330
Big Brother Gai!

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.880
ChoRyuJin, setup complete!

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:41.380
Goldion Hammer!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:43.720
Mirror Coating, set!

00:20:50.600 --> 00:20:52.520
We're gonna get crushed!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.270
Now's your chance!

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.440
Confirming coordinates! Launch!

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:15.750
Are you all right, Special Agent Mamoru?

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:18.670
Waha! That gave me a heart attack!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.420
Sorry, Pliers.

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:27.220
We'll go back to base and get you fixed up as soon as possible.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.600
Thanks to you, everyone's safe.

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:34.180
All right, mission accomplished!

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:35.730
They did it!

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:37.520
Thank goodness!

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:42.690
Thanks to the Pliers, GaoGaiGar was able to get out of a major jam.

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:46.570
But since there's no way of knowing when the Zonders will appear next...

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:51.450
...the Key to Victory lies in modifying the Goldion Hammer quickly!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.460
We're gonna be late! We're gonna be late!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:05.970
It's all because you made me show you my homework, Takayasu!

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:07.760
Hey, you blaming me?

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:08.930
I sure am!

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.810
I showed you mine the other day!

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.810
We better hurry or we'll be late!

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:13.270
Oh, that's right!

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:14.560
Wait up!

00:22:15.640 --> 00:22:17.480
Hey, this isn't good!

00:22:18.560 --> 00:22:19.600
Excellent!

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:20.520
Huh?

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:23.480
Now you three are what I call exemplary students of this school!

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:25.570
Good morning, sir!

00:22:25.690 --> 00:22:26.990
Good morning.

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:30.820
Now, then. Better hurry, boys, or class will start without you.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:32.870
Yes, sir!

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:37.750
Make sure you don't fall, running in the halls like that...

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.
